Value Required IP_ADDRESS (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value Required MAC_ADDRESS (\S+)
Value VLAN_ID (\d+)
Value INTERFACE (\S+)
Value AGING (\S+)
Value TYPE (\S+)

Start
  ^IP\s+ADDRESS\s+MAC\s+ADDRESS\s+EXPIRE\(M\)\s+TYPE\s+INTERFACE\s+VPN-INSTANCE
  ^\s+VLAN/CEVLAN\s+PVC
  ^-+
  ^${IP_ADDRESS}\s+${MAC_ADDRESS}\s+${TYPE}\s* -> Record
  ^${IP_ADDRESS}\s+${MAC_ADDRESS}\s+${VLAN_ID}\s+${INTERFACE}\s+${AGING}\s+${TYPE}\s* -> Record
  ^Total:\d+\s+Dynamic:\d+\s+Static:\d+\s+Interface:\d+\s+Remote:\d+
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error
